        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Nebukadineza asimbga n’umutima, ahaguruka n’ingoga; abaza abajanama biwe, ati Mbega harya ntitwatereye mu muriro abantu batatu baboshwe? Bishura umwami, bati Koko n’ abo, mugenzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
