            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Nebukadineza yīgira ku muryango w’iryo tanure ry’umuriro uhinda, ashira ijwi hejuru, ati Yemwe Shaduraka na Meshaki na Abedunego, mwa basavyi b’Imana isumba vyose, ni musohoke, muze hano. Nuko Shaduraka na Meshaki na Abedunego baca barasohoka bava hagati mu muriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
