              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 11:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ivyēgēra vy’umwami n’abaganwa n’abagabisha n’abajanama b’umwami bakoranye bitegereza abo bagabo, basanga umuriro utāshoboye kugira ico ubagira ku mibiri yabo, kandi n’umushatsi wo ku mitwe yabo utābabutse, n’imyinjiro yabo ata co yabaye, haba n’akarangu k’umuriro bonukako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.27"
            ]
