              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza aravuga, at’ Imana ya Shaduraka na Meshaki na Abedunego iragahimbazwa, ni yo yarungitse umumarayika wayo, igakiza abasavyi bayo bayizigiye, kukw ijambo ryanje baricishije ukundi, bagaheba amagara yabo, kugira ngo ntibagire iyindi mana n’imwe basaba canke basenga, atar’ Imana yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
